{"ts":"2026-07-26T01:00:18.735Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-fhhhlk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-716: detect npm and Slack credential shapes in mutation secret guard"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The write-time mutation secret guard misses fixed-prefix npm and Slack credential shapes, including registry authentication lines, so block mode can persist them into public item and history files. Add bounded low-false-positive detectors, keep matched values redacted from all errors and telemetry, cover advise and block modes across mutation surfaces, and document the rule inventory."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-26T01:00:18.735Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-26T01:00:18.735Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Npm and Slack fixed-prefix credential shapes are detected in bare, assignment, and registry-style text without storing or echoing matched values; Advise and block modes behave consistently across CLI, SDK, MCP, batch, and annotation mutation surfaces; False-positive fixtures for placeholders, hashes, package names, and ordinary prose remain allowed; Secret scan, full coverage, static security gates, and temporary public-tracker acceptance pass"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-pim7"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-92if","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-26T01:00:18.735Z"},{"id":"pm-g072","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-26T01:00:18.735Z"},{"id":"pm-h4zb","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-26T01:00:18.735Z"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-26T01:00:18.735Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check: searched all statuses for npm token,Slack token,secret-guard detectors,registry auth,and fixed-prefix credentials. Closed pm-h4zb covers GitHub token hygiene and pm-pim7 owns the general guard,but no item covers these missing detector classes; this is a distinct security issue linked to both."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"139a3c54ecd98f7feb1507a3340aa33cd09c1b5a61fb1e0c2d10e24152bd4e68","message":""}
